---
// Vastness without more stars: four enormous, very-low-opacity soft glows at
// different scales, positions and faint tonal variation, purely CSS (no SVG
// needed for a plain radial fade). The extra two (c, d) are smaller and
// placed off-centre so the field reads as asymmetric depth rather than two
// mirrored blobs. Sits behind the existing Step 3 starfield, which this
// component never touches.
---

<div class="deep-space-field" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="deep-space-glow deep-space-glow-a"></div>
  <div class="deep-space-glow deep-space-glow-b"></div>
  <div class="deep-space-glow deep-space-glow-c"></div>
  <div class="deep-space-glow deep-space-glow-d"></div>
</div>
